<!-- @after 11. Where to Read More :: recap -->
### Say these in the interview

- **Start from the critical journey,** then pick the 4-6 dimensions that can change its design; don't recite all 13.
- **Turn each one into a number:** a measurable budget, a failure policy and an owner.
- **Name the trade-offs out loud,** for example performance against battery, or privacy against observability.
- **Call out what only mobile has:** process death, Doze and App Standby, runtime permissions and OEM battery killers.
- **Spend about two minutes.** Skipping NFRs reads as happy-path thinking; five minutes is padding.
